ress PowerPoint and more. Free, no sign-up, no watermark — files never leave your device."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://indiadigital.org/og/default.png"><link rel="alternate" type="text/plain" title="Site summary for AI assistants" href="/llms.txt"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://indiadigital.org/#organization","name":"IndiaDigital","url":"https://indiadigital.org/","logo":"https://indiadigital.org/favicon.svg","description":"Free PDF, image, office and everyday tools that process files in the browser, without uploading them.","areaServed":"IN"},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://indiadigital.org/#website","name":"IndiaDigital","url":"https://indiadigital.org/","inLanguage":"en-IN","publisher":{"@id":"https://indiadigital.org/#organization"},"potentialAction":{"@type":"SearchAction","target":"https://indiadigital.org/?q={search_term_string}","query-input":"required name=search_term_string"}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is IndiaDigital really free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every tool is free to use, with no sign-up, no watermark and no daily limit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are my files uploaded to a server?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Files are processed by your own browser on your device and are never uploaded. You can check this yourself in your browser’s developer tools: processing makes no file uploads."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I compress a PDF to 100 KB or 200 KB for a form?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Open Compress PDF to 100 KB (or another size), drop your PDF and download. Picture compression keeps text sharp; pages are only rebuilt as images if that is the only way to meet the limit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I convert Word, Excel and PowerPoint to PDF without Micros