drop a file.</p></div><div><details open=""><summary>Is IndiaDigital really free?</summary><p>Yes. Every tool is free to use, with no sign-up, no watermark and no daily limit.</p></details><details><summary>Are my files uploaded to a server?</summary><p>No. Files are processed by your own browser on your device and are never uploaded. You can check this yourself in your browser’s developer tools: processing makes no file uploads.</p></details><details><summary>How do I compress a PDF to 100 KB or 200 KB for a form?</summary><p>Open Compress PDF to 100 KB (or another size), drop your PDF and download. Picture compression keeps text sharp; pages are only rebuilt as images if that is the only way to meet the limit.</p></details><details><summary>Can I convert Word, Excel and PowerPoint to PDF without Microsoft Office?</summary><p>Yes. The converters render your document in the browser and keep headings, tables, pictures and colours, producing a PDF with selectable text.</p></details><details><summary>Does it work on my phone?</summary><p>Yes. IndiaDigital works in modern browsers on Android, iPhone, Windows, Mac and Linux. Very large files are faster on a computer.</p></details></div></section></main><footer><div class="footer-top"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="wordmark" href="/"><svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="36" height="36" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 9v22M8 9h10M8 31h10" stroke="var(--saffron)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M20 9h5c14 0 14 22 0 22h-5V9Z" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M13 21h7" stroke="var(--success)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>india<span>digital</span></a><p>Free PDF, image and office tools that work right in your browser. Your files never leave your device.</p><span class="footer-badge">0 bytes uploaded · No sign-up · No watermark</span></div><nav class="footer-cols" aria-label="Footer"><div><strong>PDF tool